   "rendered": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"426\" height=\"600\" src=\"https://buguitr.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/128922l.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8460\" srcset=\"https://buguitr.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/128922l.jpg 426w, https://buguitr.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/128922l-213x300.jpg 213w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 426px) 100vw, 426px\" /></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><em>ADLARI:</em></strong> Sasaki to Miyano &#8211; Sotsugyou-hen, Sasaki and Miyano &#8211; Graduation, 映画 佐々木と宮野ー卒業編ー<br><strong><em>ÜLKE | DİL:</em></strong> JAPONYA | JAPONCA<br><strong><em>FİLM </em></strong><br><strong><em>ÇIKIŞ TARİHİ: </em></strong>17 Şubat 2023<br></p>\n</blockquote>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><em>Çevirmen:</em></strong> <a href=\"https://x.com/blacksyke?s=20\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://x.com/blacksyke?s=20\">blacksyke</a><br><strong><em>Editör:</em></strong> <a href=\"https://x.com/haruchannie_?t=Lv5cAmYYN4Gu9KQPTIYPUA&amp;s=09\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://x.com/haruchannie_?t=Lv5cAmYYN4Gu9KQPTIYPUA&amp;s=09\">haruchannie_</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" id=\"mignon-민용-konusu\"> KONUSU</h4>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Miyano günlerini huzur içinde Yaoi Manga okuyup yüzünün feminenliğini dert ederek geçirir. Bir tesadüf onu üst sınıf öğrencisi Sasaki’yle bir çekişmeye sürükler. Çekingen Miyano’yu ilgi çekici bulan serseri Sasaki onunla yakınlaşmak için her fırsatı değerlendirir.   </p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><em>    Sasaki ve Miyano&#8217;nun ilişkilerinin devamını anlatan filmdir. </em></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-fe48e5de wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://buguitr.com/sasaki-to-miyano-sotsugyou-hen-2/\"><strong>FİLMİ İZLE</strong></a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--2\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://buguitr.com/sasaki-to-miyano-turkce-anime/\">ANİME</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n",
